      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Krishnapuram estate... Chandragiri estate... people keep coming from all those places asking for Uma's hand! I can become related only to a zamindar family like that; don't bring me collectors, tahsildars, mirasdars, mittadars and whoever else! This is the first and last time for you...",
