        "english_text": "Did you hear, Kokila... Some Collector’s family, it seems, came asking for Uma’s hand—a Collector! I spoke firmly and sent them away.. I told them that only from an estate family with mansions and towers could a bridegroom come for her! What, was I right?..."
      }
